title: Game Over.
new-page: true
go-to: eg_menu
on-arrival: {!
// generated by scripts/gen_game_over.py: edit the tables there, not this file
Q.game_over = 1;

// vote shares in each group of voters, used by the achievements
for (var c of Q.classes) {
    var class_votes = 0;
    for (var party of Q.parties) {
        if (Q[c+'_'+party] < 0) {
            Q[c+'_'+party] = 0;
        }
        class_votes += Q[c+'_'+party] || 0;
    }
    for (var party of Q.parties) {
        Q[c + '_' + party + '_normalized'] = class_votes > 0 ? Math.round(100*(Q[c+'_'+party] || 0)/class_votes) : 0;
    }
}

// the main ending: the first one whose condition holds
if (Q.afd_in_government) {
    Q.ending = 'schwarz_blau';
} else if (Q.spd_r >= 30 && Q.chancellor_party == "SPD") {
    Q.ending = 'volkspartei_kehrt_zurueck';
} else if (Q.spd_r < 15 || Q.sapd_formed || Q.srpd_formed) {
    Q.ending = 'langer_abstieg';
} else if (Q.spd_in_government && Q.spd_r < 20) {
    Q.ending = 'juniorpartner';
} else if (!Q.spd_in_government && Q.spd_r >= 15 && Q.dissent < 0.3) {
    Q.ending = 'neuaufbau';
} else if (Q.afd_r < 20 && Q.firewall_erosion < 5 && Q.trust_in_democracy >= 55) {
    Q.ending = 'mitte_haelt';
} else if (true) {
    Q.ending = 'offenes_ende';
}

// achievements
if (true) {
    this.achieve('game_completed');
}
if (Q.difficulty == -1 && !Q.afd_in_government) {
    this.achieve('einigkeit');
}
if (Q.difficulty == 0 && !Q.afd_in_government) {
    this.achieve('einigkeit_und_recht');
}
if (Q.difficulty >= 1 && !Q.afd_in_government) {
    this.achieve('einigkeit_und_recht_und_freiheit');
}
if (Q.afd_r < 20 && Q.firewall_erosion < 5 && !Q.afd_in_government) {
    this.achieve('brandmauer');
}
if (Q.spd_r >= 30 && Q.chancellor_party == "SPD") {
    this.achieve('volkspartei_kehrt_zurueck');
}
if (Q.unemployment_rate < 5 && Q.inflation < 3 && Q.budget >= 0) {
    this.achieve('wirtschaftswunder');
}
if ((Q.nationalization_progress >= 1 && Q.investment_implemented >= 1) || (Q.investment_implemented >= 1 && Q.moderate_plan_progress >= 1) || (Q.nationalization_progress >= 1 && Q.moderate_plan_progress >= 1)) {
    this.achieve('wirtschaftsexperiment');
}
if (!Q.economic_plan) {
    this.achieve('freie_marktwirtschaft');
}
if (Q.spd_in_government && ((Q.nationalization_progress >= 2 && Q.economic_democracy >= 3) || (Q.nationalization_progress >= 1 && Q.economic_democracy >= 4))) {
    this.achieve('raterepublik');
}
if (Q.factory_takeovers >= 2) {
    this.achieve('syndikalismus');
}
if ((Q.womens_work && Q.womens_rights >= 5) || (Q.abortion_rights && Q.womens_rights >= 3)) {
    this.achieve('equality');
}
if (Q.homosexual_rights >= 2) {
    this.achieve('hirschfeld');
}
if (Q.new_middle_spd_normalized >= 40) {
    this.achieve('panik_im_mittelstand');
}
if (Q.rural_spd_normalized >= 40) {
    this.achieve('bauernrevolution');
}
if (Q.catholics_spd_normalized >= 30) {
    this.achieve('katholischer_sozialismus');
}
if (Q.workers_spd_normalized >= 50 && Q.new_middle_spd_normalized < 20 && Q.old_middle_spd_normalized < 20 && Q.rural_spd_normalized < 20) {
    this.achieve('klassenkampf');
}
if (Q.classes.every(function (c) { return Q[c + "_spd_normalized"] >= 30; })) {
    this.achieve('grosse_volkspartei');
}
if (Q.welfare > 0 && Q.judicial_reform >= 2 && Q.womens_work >= 1 && Q.family_law >= 1 && Q.upper_tax_rates > Q.lower_tax_rates && Q.works_councils > 0 && Q.eu > 0) {
    this.achieve('heidelberger_programm');
}
!}

= The End

@eg_menu

- #endings
- @end_game: End game.

@ending_schwarz_blau
title: Schwarz-Blau
view-if: ending = "schwarz_blau"
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

The AfD sits in the federal government. The firewall that the democratic parties built after 2017 did not hold. The Basic Law still stands, and the courts, the Länder and millions of citizens resist. But the republic has entered its most dangerous years since 1949, and the SPD must now defend democracy from opposition.

@ending_volkspartei_kehrt_zurueck
title: Die Volkspartei kehrt zurück
view-if: ending = "volkspartei_kehrt_zurueck"
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

Against all predictions, the SPD has become a true people's party again. With more than 30% of the vote, it leads the federal government. Commentators who wrote its obituary in 2025 are writing very different columns now.

@ending_langer_abstieg
title: Der lange Abstieg
view-if: ending = "langer_abstieg"
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

The SPD has gone the way of PASOK and the French Socialists. Split, shrunken and without a clear idea of what it is for, the oldest party in Germany fights for relevance. Its voters have scattered to the Grüne, the Linke, the Union and the AfD.

@ending_juniorpartner
title: Juniorpartner auf Dauer
view-if: ending = "juniorpartner"
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

The SPD is in government, but as a junior partner with less than a fifth of the vote. It delivers laws and ministers, but the credit goes to others, and every election looks like the last one.

@ending_neuaufbau
title: Neuaufbau in der Opposition
view-if: ending = "neuaufbau"
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

The SPD is in opposition. But it is united, and with its new programme and a younger generation of leaders, it is rebuilding for the next election.

@ending_mitte_haelt
title: Die Mitte hält
view-if: ending = "mitte_haelt"
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

Whatever the fortunes of the SPD, the democratic centre has held. The AfD has passed its peak, trust in democracy is recovering, and the republic has come through its crisis years.

@ending_offenes_ende
title: Ein offenes Ende
view-if: ending = "offenes_ende"
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

The SPD has survived the crisis years, neither triumphant nor broken. What becomes of it is still an open question.

@economy_good
title: The economy
view-if: unemployment_rate < 6 and inflation < 4
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

The economy is in good shape: unemployment is low and prices are stable.

@economy_bad
title: The economy
view-if: unemployment_rate >= 6 or inflation >= 4
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

The economy is still struggling. [? if unemployment_rate >= 6 : Too many people are out of work. ?][? if inflation >= 4 : Prices are rising too fast. ?]

@afd_strong
title: The far right
view-if: afd_r >= 20 and afd_in_government = 0
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

The AfD is still one of the strongest parties, and the firewall is under constant pressure.

@afd_weak
title: The far right
view-if: afd_r < 20 and afd_in_government = 0
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

The AfD has lost ground, though it has not gone away.

@european_union
title: Europe
view-if: eu = 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

Europe has reformed itself: it borrows together for its defence and its energy transition, and a single government can no longer block it.

@peoples_party_achieved
title: A big-tent party
view-if: peoples_party = 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

The SPD has opened itself to the centre. Whether this saved the party or cost it its soul is still debated.

@nationalization_achieved
title: Public ownership
view-if: nationalization_progress >= 2
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

A large part of German industry is now in public hands, run together with its workers.

@works_councils
title: Codetermination
view-if: works_councils >= 3
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

Workers now have a real say over investment and plant closures.

@works_program
title: The Zukunftsprogramm
view-if: works_program > 0
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

Our public investment programme has left its mark: new rail lines, power grids and schools across the country.

@faction_left
title: The party
view-if: left_strength >= center_strength and left_strength >= labor_strength and left_strength >= reformist_strength
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

The Parlamentarische Linke sets the course of the party.

@faction_center
title: The party
view-if: center_strength > left_strength and center_strength >= labor_strength and center_strength >= reformist_strength
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

Netzwerk Berlin sets the course of the party.

@faction_labor
title: The party
view-if: labor_strength > left_strength and labor_strength > center_strength and labor_strength >= reformist_strength
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

The AfA and the unions set the course of the party.

@faction_reformist
title: The party
view-if: reformist_strength > left_strength and reformist_strength > center_strength and reformist_strength > labor_strength
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

The Seeheimer Kreis sets the course of the party.

@achievements
title: Achievements
view-if: achievement_game_completed == 1
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu if started == 1; root.start_menu_2 if started == 0

